    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Canoptek Court",
    "summary": "These areas belong to your Power Matrix:\n\n- Your deployment zone, always.\n- No Man’s Land, for any phase that starts with you controlling half or more of its objective markers.\n- The enemy deployment zone, for any phase that starts with you controlling half or more of the objective markers in it.\n\nAttacks made by **CRYPTEK** and **CANOPTEK** models of yours re-roll **Hit rolls** of 1. If the attacker's unit is wholly inside your Power Matrix, any Hit roll may be re-rolled instead.",
